# pstack (michael-denyer/pstack-claude), installed for this repo only and kept out of it
# (Claude Code Game Studios' 49 agents and 74 skills share these folders and are tracked: they were added with
# `git add -f`, so git follows them anyway; a new one from a later studio release needs `git add -f` too)
.claude/pstack/
.claude/agents/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/verify/

